  "description": "GroupDocs.Rewriter Cloud is a simple SDK used to add paraphrasing of Microsoft Word or Open Office documents, Adobe PDF documents, Markdown files, HTML files and plain text to your app with merely a few lines of code.\nIn detail, it's a set of SDKs for document and plain text rewriting in our Cloud. It supports paraphrasing of .doc, .docx, .docm, .odt, .txt, .rtf, .md, .html and .pdf files. Just pass a specific file or text to the GroupDocs.Rewriter Cloud API, and it will rewrite and save rewrited file in our Cloud or will return paraphrased text.",
